      "spam": false,
      "value": "@{58c6cbcffd04b1785f747b6c|full_name}: Not sure, but outside of VR, there's some games where their communities use this sort of system to handle reports, I've been on some of them and on the Administration side and I found it quite organized and good to handle multiple and detailed reports that we could take our time dealing with them compared to emergencies or in-game real time moderation. I suggested it first directly to VR Pill cause I was not sure, he told me it was a good idea and should put it on canny so I did.",
